'''Spectral''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 29th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Spectral is a solid black knife with wavy green, flame-like lines around the whole knife.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Spectral (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

